    "id": "p9-q6-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "6",
    "prompt": "A group of students were asked whether they play cricket and tennis. The Venn diagram shows the results.\n\nWhat is the probability that a student selected at random plays cricket or tennis?",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 2,
