    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\frac{13}{15}$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Total} &= 12+5+9+4\\\\&=30\\\\P(\\text{cricket or tennis}) &= \\frac{12+5+9}{30}\\\\&=\\frac{26}{30}\\\\&=\\frac{13}{15}\\end{align*}$$",
